# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SHARED reverse proxy for this VPS — canonical copy.
# Deployed to:  /etc/caddy/Caddyfile   (host Caddy, systemd unit "caddy")
#
# This is the ONE public entry point on the box. Only ports 80/443 are open to
# the internet (+22 for SSH); every app listens on 127.0.0.1 and is reached only
# through here. Caddy obtains/renews Let's Encrypt certs automatically once the
# hostnames' DNS A records point at this VPS (159.195.80.109).
#
# Each PROJECT contributes ONE file under /etc/caddy/sites/. To onboard a new
# project (e.g. cybersiren) you add sites/<project>.caddy and `caddy reload` —
# you do NOT touch this file. See infrastructure/reverse-proxy/RUNBOOK.md.
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
